Hello all,

Please find the test report of oFono v1.13 commit 7a6da06.

During this testing, we ran 34 functional positive cases. 32 cases =

passed, 1 failed and 1 blocked due to bug (see Issue Summary section for =

details). The Pass Rate is 94% (-6% vs previous session). One regression =

has been found concerning Lock/Unlock PIN code feature.

Specifically for 1.13 release which supports HFP 1.6 features, a PTS =

test session has been also run to validate it. We ran a total of 75 =

functional positive cases. 72 cases passed, 0 failed and 3 blocked due =

to issue (see Notes section for details) or feature not supported. The =

Pass Rate is 96%.

If you have any comment about this report, tell me please.

-----------------------------------------------

*Test Objective *

The aim of this session was to validate the state of oFono upstream by =

testing only major tests of most important features over all material we =

had (according to what feature was supported and by priority order: PR3, =

Network Simulator, 3G dongle) and specifically for 1.13 release which =

supports HFP 1.6 features a PTS test session has been also run to =

validate it. oFono has been installed and tested on PR3 running Tizen =

2.0 and Ubuntu 12.04 device for standard Telephony features and =

installed on IVI board for HFP features.

