*Notes***

Please note that one oFono crash still occurs on the following conditions:
-OF-163 <https://01.org/jira/browse/OF-163>- oFono crashes when doing a =

NAA Initialization+File Change Notification after having done a NAA =

Initialization+Full File Change Notification with Phonesim.

A bug in PTS software (11515 =

<https://www.bluetooth.org/pts/issues/view_issue.cfm?id=3D11515> which =

sends to oFono the wrong HFP version supported) preventing to execute =

several TCs has been avoided during test session.
/    Workaround details:/
/        1.//Change the HFP version in /var/lib/Bluetooth/<Local mac =

address>/cache/<PTS mac address>/
/        2.//Kill Bluetoothd/
/        3.//Relaunch Bluetoothd/
/        4.//Redo the PTS tests that was blocked by this issue./

